# Interpolated String slots, one the schema's `key`, so dedup depends on the
# rendered text:
#
#   id=1 kitchen 7  -> "kitchen-007"   a new Tagged
#   id=2 kitchen 7  -> "kitchen-007"   same key, so no new fact
#   id=3 kitchen 9  -> "kitchen-009"   a different key, a second Tagged
#
# `final facts=5` (three Readings, two Tagged). The `log` message carries the
# zero-padded level too, so a dropped pad shows there.
assert Reading id=1 zone=kitchen level=7
pump
assert Reading id=2 zone=kitchen level=7
pump
assert Reading id=3 zone=kitchen level=9
pump
